{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野日奈子です(｡・・｡)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はアルバム特典会の\nボーリング大会がありました～♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ボーリングは苦手です( ˘ｰωｰ˘ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チームの皆さんの足を引っ張ってしまいました( ˘ｰωｰ˘ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この日のための練習しなかったからかな( ˘ｰωｰ˘ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんと日奈子へたっぴでした( ˘ｰωｰ˘ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごめんなさい( ˘ｰωｰ˘ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、すごく楽しかったです♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/07/31/7440147/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いおりちゃん\nかわいい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/07/31/7440147/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/07/31/7440147/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お団子こうげき～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":